        formula: "E × T = constant ⇒ T₁/T₂ = E₂/E₁<br>Quick ratio method: take the reciprocal of a time ratio, then clear fractions by multiplying through by their LCM — e.g. 20:30:60 → 1/20:1/30:1/60 → (×60) → 3:2:1",
